                        <h1 class="ad-title">The Limits of Authority of Regional Heads as Protectors of the Indonesian Red Cross (PMI) under the Red Cross Law</h1>

            
                                        <div class="ad-author-chips">
                                            <span class="ad-author-chip">
                            <span class="ad-author-chip__avatar">
                                S
                            </span>
                            Stefanus Kurniadi Janggur
                        </span>
                                    </div>
            
                        <div class="ad-metabar">
                                    <span class="ad-metabar__item">
                        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
                        09 December 2025
                    </span>
                                                    <span class="ad-metabar__sep"></span>
                    <span class="ad-metabar__item">
                        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/></svg>
